 the total program spend to date to $51 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/celestica-inc-cls-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q1","e":"cls","d":"2019-04-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"We are taking a number of restructuring actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/celestica-inc-cls-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q2","e":"cls","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"Restructuring charges related to our cost efficiency initiative were $9 million this quarter, including charges related to our capital equipment business, bringing the total program spend to date to $60 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/celestica-inc-cls-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q2","e":"cls","d":"2019-07-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"The second is -- and you're touching on it -- we've generated losses in capital equipment by driving restructuring and those losses are landing in geographies where we pay very little to sometimes no tax.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/24/celestica-inc-cls-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q3","e":"cls","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Unidentified Participant","x":"And then finally, for either of you, on the tariff impact, any update there in terms of what you're saying?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/celestica-inc-cls-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q3","e":"cls","d":"2019-10-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"The tariff impact, I think it's the beat goes on as they say, we haven't noticed anymore material changes and we've seen in the past.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/celestica-inc-cls-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q3","e":"cls","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Mionis","x":"While demand in the capital equipment market remains muted in the business continue to operate at a loss, we delivered sequential improvements, primarily as a result of ongoing cost reduction actions and slightly higher volume.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/celestica-inc-cls-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q3","e":"cls","d":"2019-10-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"Our capital equipment business operated at a loss in the mid single-digit million-dollar range, which was slightly better than expected due to stronger-than-anticipated demand and the impact of our cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/25/celestica-inc-cls-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2020-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Mionis","x":"At this time last year, people were building buffers due to the tariffs and those buffers were in our revenue numbers last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/celestica-inc-cls-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"Although Capital Equipment lost money in the low-single-digit millions, the business improved relative to last quarter due to higher demand and the positive impact of our cost reduction initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/celestica-inc-cls-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2019 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"We incurred a $11 million in restructuring charges this quarter and have concluded our cost efficiency initiative.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/30/celestica-inc-cls-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q1","e":"cls","d":"2020-04-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Rob Mionis","x":"I think early on, in the first couple of innings, there was the tariff situation and now there's a lot of discussion about localization, things along those lines.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/celestica-inc-cls-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q1","e":"cls","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rob Mionis","x":"Capital equipment had posted a loss for the last five quarters, and we are pleased that our restructuring actions and improved mix have accelerated its recovery.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/celestica-inc-cls-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q1","e":"cls","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"In the first quarter, we incurred $8 million of restructuring charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/celestica-inc-cls-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q1","e":"cls","d":"2020-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rob Mionis","x":"First quarter revenue fell slightly below our withdrawn guidance range, but profitability was ultimately in line with beginning of quarter expectations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/celestica-inc-cls-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q2","e":"cls","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"In the second quarter, we incurred $7 million of restructuring charges, including costs to right-size our commercial aerospace and industrial cost base to reflect a reduction in overall demand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/celestica-inc-cls-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q2","e":"cls","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"We continue to take restructuring actions in the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/celestica-inc-cls-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q3","e":"cls","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"In the third quarter, we incurred $4 million of restructuring charges to adjust our cost base to fluctuating levels of demand, including in our A&D business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/celestica-inc-cls-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q3","e":"cls","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"We will continue to take restructuring actions in the fourth quarter as we complete the Cisco transition and adjust our cost base across segments undergoing demand pressure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/29/celestica-inc-cls-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2021-01-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rob Mionis","x":"We have a healthy business as data centers continue to expand AI and ML applications may continue to grow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/celestica-inc-cls-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2021-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"In the fourth quarter, we incurred $7 million of restructuring charges to adjust our cost base to better adapt to fluctuating levels of demand, including in our A&D business and as we completed the Cisco Disengagement.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/27/celestica-inc-cls-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLS 2020 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2021-01-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"For the full-year 2020, we have recorded $26 million of restructuring charges against our earlier estimate of