 2025 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2026-01-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"In support of their large scale investments in data center infrastructure, and AI capabilities. capacity additions at our largest sites, These investments will include a combination of new customer driven investments in The United States, and upgrades to manufacturing capabilities, including…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/celestica-cls-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLS 2025 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2026-01-29","l":"tariffs","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"These are based on management's current expectations, forecasts, and assumptions including that there are no material changes to tariff or trade restrictions compared to what is in effect as of January 28.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/celestica-cls-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLS 2025 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2026-01-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Chao","x":"So within your guidance, how much do you bake in the price increase of key components or materials?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/celestica-cls-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLS 2025 Q4","e":"cls","d":"2026-01-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rob Mionis","x":"We are maintaining our outlook for revenues to remain approximately flat to up in the mid single digits percentage range for the full year 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/celestica-cls-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CLS 2026 Q1","e":"cls","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mandeep Chawla","x":"Our enterprise end market revenue was higher by 101% and driven by the planned ramping of a next-generation AI/ML compute program with a hyperscaler customer.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/celestica-cls-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CLS 2026 